#: ../../library/ssl.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`ssl` --- SSL/TLS module"
msgstr "Modul :mod:`ssl` --- SSL/TLS"

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module provides access to Transport Layer Security (previously and "
"widely known as “Secure Sockets Layer”) encryption and peer authentication "
"facilities for network sockets, both client-side and server-side."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini menyediakan akses ke fasilitas enkripsi Transport Layer Security "
"(sebelumnya dan secara luas dikenal sebagai \"Secure Sockets Layer\") serta "
"autentikasi peer untuk soket jaringan, baik sisi klien maupun sisi server."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:13
msgid ""
"**New to TLS on the camera?** Start with the :ref:`tls_certificates` "
"tutorial. It walks through choosing key types, creating and converting "
"certificates to the DER format the camera requires, getting them onto the "
"device, and verifying servers and clients -- with complete working examples."
msgstr ""
"**Baru mengenal TLS di kamera?** Mulailah dengan tutorial "
":ref:`tls_certificates`\\ . Tutorial tersebut membahas pemilihan jenis "
"kunci, pembuatan dan konversi sertifikat ke format DER yang diperlukan "
"kamera, cara menempatkannya di perangkat, serta verifikasi server dan klien "
"-- dengan contoh kerja lengkap."

#: ../../library/ssl.rst:21
msgid ""
"MicroPython does not implement ``ssl.SSLError``. SSL/TLS failures are raised"
" as ``OSError`` instead."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython tidak mengimplementasikan ``ssl.SSLError``\\ . Kegagalan SSL/TLS"
" dimunculkan sebagai ``OSError``\\ ."

